,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"2","text":"ECF No. 51","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-051","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF No. 51","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":18,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-2-1-1-ca6bb0c8","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"2","text":"Minute Order of March 27, 2026","n":"1","kind":"docket","target_doc":"DDC-MO","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Minute Order (Mar. 27, 2026)","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":19,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-2-1-1-92319dbd","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"2","text":"Dkt. 51","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-051","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Dkt. 51","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":20,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-2-1-1-5f697ce9","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"2","text":"ECF No. 16","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-016","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF No. 16 (Notice of Exhibit Limitations and Sealed Filing Request, Jan. 20, 2026)","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":21,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-2-1-1-e19da689","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"2","text":"LCvR 5.4(e)(1)","n":"1","kind":"rule","target_doc":"Local Rules AUG_2025","target_page":"27","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"LCvR 5.4(e)(1)","status":"verified","target_quote":"(1) Every unsealed document (including an administrative record or a record of state court proceedings) must be filed electronically. Every document filed under seal in a totally sealed case shall be filed in paper form accompanied by an electronic copy in a format deemed compatible by the Clerk's Office with CM/ECF filing in conformity with the requirements of LCvR 5.1. Any document, exhibit, or attachment, including sealed material that (A) is not in a format that readily permits electronic filing, such as a map, chart or DVD, or (B) is illegible when scanned into electronic format, is to be maintained in the possession of the attorney or pro se party responsible for the filing. Such a filing shall be made available for a party or the Court and must be identified in a Notice of Filing filed with the Court. A document or item filed pursuant to this subsection shall be served, if it is necessary to serve it, by mail or by hand delivery, unless the parties have otherwise agreed.","line":22,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-2-1-1-69eed61e","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":27,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"2","text":"Local Civil Rule 5.4(e)(1)","n":"1","kind":"rule","target_doc":"Local Rules AUG_2025","target_page":"27","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"LCvR 5.4(e)(1)","status":"verified","target_quote":"is not in a format that readily permits electronic filing, such as a map, chart or DVD, or (B) is illegible when scanned into electronic format","line":23,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-2-1-1-902ff233","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":27,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"3","text":"Section V infra","n":"1","kind":"internal","target_doc":"DDC-053","target_page":"4","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Section V","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":24,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-3-1-1-2a5aef9b","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":4,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"3","text":"Federal Rule of Evidence 901(b)(4)","n":"1","kind":"rule","target_doc":"Federal Rules of Evidence (Dec. 1, 2025, uscourts.gov official pamphlet)","target_page":"24","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Rule 901(b)(4)","status":"verified","target_quote":"(4) Distinctive Characteristics and the Like. The appearance, contents, substance, internal patterns, or other distinctive characteristics of the item, taken together with all the circumstances.","line":25,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-3-1-1-c256a3b4","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":39,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"3","text":"FRE 902(13)","n":"1","kind":"rule","target_doc":"Federal Rules of Evidence (Dec. 1, 2025, uscourts.gov official pamphlet)","target_page":"26","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Rule 902(13)","status":"verified","target_quote":"(13) Certified Records Generated by an Electronic Process or System. A record generated by an electronic process or system that produces an accurate result, as shown by a certification of a qualified person that complies with the certification re-quirements of Rule 902(11) or (12). The proponent must also meet the notice requirements of Rule 902(11).","line":26,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-3-1-1-8b49429e","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":41,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"3","text":"FRE 902(14)","n":"1","kind":"rule","target_doc":"Federal Rules of Evidence (Dec. 1, 2025, uscourts.gov official pamphlet)","target_page":"26","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Rule 902(14)","status":"verified","target_quote":"(14) Certified Data Copied from an Electronic Device, Storage Medium, or File. Data copied from an electronic device, storage medium, or file, if authenticated by a process of digital identification, as shown by a certification of a qualified person that complies with the certification requirements of Rule 902(11) or (12). The proponent also must meet the notice requirements of Rule 902(11).","line":27,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-3-1-1-72ff35e4","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":41,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"3","text":"Compl. ¶ 11","n":"1","kind":"tac","target_doc":"DDC-051","target_page":"18","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 11","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":28,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-3-1-1-57a0b810","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":18,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"3","text":"App. I ¶ 1","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-051-21","target_page":"4","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 1","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":29,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-3-1-1-083104c9","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":4,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"4","text":"Compl. ¶ 52","n":"1","kind":"tac","target_doc":"DDC-051","target_page":"41","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 52","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":30,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-4-1-1-5e1bfc3c","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":4,"target_pdf_page":41,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-053","src_page":"4","text":"USB Attachments Index, REC-Series","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-053-01","target_page":"13","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"REC-Series","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":31,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-053-4-1-1-fb2c5e71","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":4,"target_pdf_page":13,"tar